   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study to Create MIF Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Multilateral Investment Fund (MIF) study was approved in the last quarter of 2010 for CAD 87,330. The study will review successful models and assess the AfDB&#x2019;s institutional capacity to adopt them and recommend options for a similar facility for the AfDB to accelerate the growth of the private sector, through streamlined delivery of grant-funded TA along with small-scale risk and investment capital.</narrative>
